OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying dry
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with high cloud
OL,7,Fand some clearer skies giving some
OL,8,Fhazy evening sunshine. Winds becoming
OL,9,Flight but remaining breezy along the
OL,10,Fcoast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FDry and bright to start,
OL,13,Fthough quickly clouding over as a band
OL,14,Fof rain moves in from the west by mid-
OL,15,Fmorning. Blustery winds developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
